		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Hateful ghouls spawned from being buried alive. Damp flesh, hollow eye-pits.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 12, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 claw +3 (1d6 + disease) or bury alive or gravedigger, <strong>MV</strong> near (burrow), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bury Alive</strong>. Seal a pit within near, burying a target alive. Suffocate in 2d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Disease</strong>. CON 12+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check each day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON,</p><p></p><p><strong>Gravedigger</strong>. Create a grave- sized pit under a target within near. DEX 15+ or fall in, DEX 9+ on turn to climb out.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
